      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the diarized_transcript.py file, I need to use a concrete external provider for speaker diarization. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API, which is a well-known service for this task. The code will include the import of the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text client and the use of the API endpoint for diarization. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
