      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the `poll_transcription.py` file, I need to create a Python script that polls a transcription job using a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Transcribe service for this task, as it is a well-known provider for batch transcription jobs. The script will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) to interact with Amazon Transcribe. It will include the provider-specific client class and API calls to poll the transcription job status and retrieve the transcript once the job is complete. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789855027401,
          "start": 1789855023806
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bbac42be001s2HST4GJYFEtg3",
      "message_id": "msg_0bbac3e7d0014V9PQsqTperVOj",
